    "section_title": "Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)",
    "text": "Food and Agriculture Organization (FAO)\n\nFood and Agriculture Organization (FAO) promotes the adoption of Conservation Agriculture principles (minimum mechanical soil disturbance (no/zero-tillage, permanent soil cover and crop rotations) that are universally applicable in all agricultural landscapes and cropping systems.",
