    "chunk_index": 12,
    "section_title": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version",
    "text": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version\n\nConservation Agriculture is 20 to 50 percent less labour intensive and thus contributes to reducing greenhouse gas emissions through lower energy inputs and improved nutrient use efficiency.",
    "paragraph_id": "f15eae70-4b61-4457-9f1c-c7ffd49979fb",
    "paragraph_index": 0
  },
