    "chunk_index": 13,
    "section_title": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version",
    "text": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version\n\nAt the same time, it stabilizes and protects soil from breaking down and releasing carbon to the atmosphere.",
    "paragraph_id": "07d94592-59cd-4dd0-9f18-7e3238270b6b",
    "paragraph_index": 0
  },
