    "section_title": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version",
    "text": "CB8350EN/1/03.22 \u2013 Revised version\n\nSpecies diversification through varied crop sequences and associations involving at least three different crop species. A well-designed crop rotation promotes good soil structure, fosters a diverse range of soil flora and fauna that contributes to nutrient cycling and improved plant nutrition, and helps to prevent pests and diseases.",
    "paragraph_id": "c9439d71-20a6-4f98-915e-68b1dacdf90a",
